BT 1 0 0 1 0 78.5 Tm 12.5 TL /F1 9 Tf .117647 .160784 .231373 rg (The ) Tj /F2 9 Tf (Care Connect) Tj /F1 9 Tf ( project successfully demonstrates a comprehensive, secure, and user-friendly digital healthcare) Tj T* (management platform. By structuring outpatient workflows around three authenticated personas\227Hospitals, Doctors, and) Tj T* (Patients\227Care Connect eliminates administrative bottlenecks, simplifies specialist discovery, and ensures transactional) Tj T* (appointment booking integrity. The platform's inclusion of ReportLab PDF generation, Zero-PHI QR code digital verification,) Tj T* (and non-diagnostic AI operational assistance illustrates how modern web technologies and ethical artificial intelligence can) Tj T* (improve healthcare administration. Backed by 263 passing automated unit tests, zero warnings, and an intact database,) Tj T* (Care Connect stands as a robust, production-ready capstone project.) Tj T* ET
